msgid "Greetings.  My name is [SPEAKER:TRANS_NAME]."
msgstr "Hälsningar. Jag heter [SPEAKER:TRANS_NAME]."

msgid "Hellooo!"
msgstr "Hallååå!"

msgid "Look at you!"
msgstr "Se på dig!"

msgid "A baby!  How adorable!"
msgstr "En bebis! Så gulligt!"

msgid "Ah, hello.  I'm [SPEAKER:TRANS_NAME]."
msgstr "Åh, hej. Jag heter [SPEAKER:TRANS_NAME]."

msgid "I am [SPEAKER:TRANS_NAME].  Can I be of some help?"
msgstr "Jag heter [SPEAKER:TRANS_NAME]. Kan jag hjälpa till?"

msgid "I am [SPEAKER:TRANS_NAME].  How can I be of service?"
msgstr "Jag heter [SPEAKER:TRANS_NAME]. Hur kan jag hjälpa till?"

msgid "Hello, [AUDIENCE:RACE].  I am [SPEAKER:TRANS_NAME]."
msgstr "Hej, [AUDIENCE:RACE]. Jag heter [SPEAKER:TRANS_NAME]."

msgid "[AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME]...  your parents must have been interesting!"
msgstr "[AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME]... dina föräldrar måste ha varit intressanta!"

msgid ""
"You know, you don't meet many people with the name [AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME]."
msgstr "Du vet, man träffar inte många som heter [AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME]."

msgid "So, [AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME]...   [AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME], was it?"
msgstr "Så, [AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME]... [AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME], var det?"

msgid "[AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME].  Does that mean something?"
msgstr "[AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME]. Betyder det något?"

msgid "[AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME].  I can't say I've heard that before."
msgstr "[AUDIENCE:FIRST_NAME]. Jag kan inte säga att jag har hört det förut."

msgid "Praise be to [SPEAKER:HF_LINK:DEITY:TRANS_NAME]."
msgstr "Prisat vare [SPEAKER:HF_LINK:DEITY:TRANS_NAME]."

msgid "Praise [SPEAKER:HF_LINK:DEITY:RANDOM_DEF_SPHERE]."
msgstr "Prisa [SPEAKER:HF_LINK:DEITY:RANDOM_DEF_SPHERE]."

msgid "Life is, in a word, [SPEAKER:HF_LINK:DEITY:RANDOM_DEF_SPHERE]."
msgstr "Livet är, kort sagt, [SPEAKER:HF_LINK:DEITY:RANDOM_DEF_SPHERE]."

msgid "This servant of [SPEAKER:HF_LINK:DEITY:TRANS_NAME] greets you."
msgstr "Denna tjänare till [SPEAKER:HF_LINK:DEITY:TRANS_NAME] hälsar dig."

msgid "This servant of [SPEAKER:HF_LINK:DEITY:RANDOM_DEF_SPHERE] greets you."
msgstr ""
"Denna tjänare till [SPEAKER:HF_LINK:DEITY:RANDOM_DEF_SPHERE] hälsar dig."

msgid "I am a guard."
msgstr "Jag är vakt."

msgid "Don't start any trouble."
msgstr "Ställ inte till med bråk."

msgid ""
"It is I that felled [CONTEXT:HIST_FIG:TRANS_NAME] the "
"[CONTEXT:HIST_FIG:RACE]."
msgstr ""
"Det var jag som fällde [CONTEXT:HIST_FIG:TRANS_NAME] av "
"[CONTEXT:HIST_FIG:RACE]."

msgid "I hunt great beasts in [CONTEXT:PLACE:TRANS_NAME]."
